      ],
      "text": "Second",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        63.09400177001953,
        21.884788513183594,
        86.86299896240234,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "edition",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.63939666748047,
        83.1881103515625,
        199.5173797607422,
        96.65460968017578
      ],
      "text": "pleural effusion; -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.63939666748047,
        102.65740966796875,
        216.54885864257812,
        116.12390899658203
      ],
      "text": "pericardial effusion; -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.63939666748047,
        122.126708984375,
        281.5238952636719,
        135.5932159423828
      ],
      "text": "distended abdomen with ascites; -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.63939666748047,
        141.59600830078125,
        418.281982421875,
        155.06251525878906
      ],
      "text": "non-painful enlarged lymph nodes without fistula formation; -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.63939666748047,
        161.665283203125,
        255.97085571289062,
        175.1317901611328
      ],
      "text": "non-painful enlarged joints. -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03490447998047,
        183.331298828125,
        513.4215698242188,
        196.68280029296875
      ],
      "text": "Children who are receiving therapeutic nutritional treatment or nutritional",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03490447998047,
        199.32781982421875,
        513.4100952148438,
        212.6793212890625
      ],
      "text": "supplementation but are still not gaining weight, or are continuing to lose weight,",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03490447998047,
        215.3243408203125,
        384.98944091796875,
        228.67584228515625
      ],
      "text": "should be considered as having a chronic disease, such as TB.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        242.49502563476562,
        194.16738891601562,
        256.71502685546875
      ],
      "text": "Tuberculin skin test",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-BoldItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        265.238525390625,
        513.4949951171875,
        278.59002685546875
      ],
      "text": "A positive TST indicates that a person is or was infected with M. tuberculosis but does",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        281.23504638671875,
        513.3800659179688,
        294.5865478515625
      ],
      "text": "not necessarily indicate TB disease. It is a test that measures immune response, not the",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        297.2315673828125,
        513.3569946289062,
        310.58306884765625
      ],
      "text": "presence/absence of bacteria. The TST can be a useful tool in the assessment of a child",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        313.22808837890625,
        513.426025390625,
        326.57958984375
      ],
      "text": "with suspected TB, especially when there is no positive history of TB contact, because a",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        329.2245788574219,
        513.434326171875,
        342.59002685546875
      ],
      "text": "positive TST indicates that the child has been infected at some point.  It may therefore  1",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03628540039062,
        345.2350158691406,
        513.5034790039062,
        358.5865173339844
      ],
      "text": "be used as an adjunct in diagnosing TB in children with signs and symptoms of TB and",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03628540039062,
        361.23150634765625,
        513.434326171875,
        374.5830078125
      ],
      "text": "in conjunction with other diagnostic tests. The TST can also be used to screen children",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03628540039062,
        377.2279968261719,
        513.4574584960938,
        390.5794982910156
      ],
      "text": "exposed to TB (such as household contact with TB), although contact screening and",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03628540039062,
        393.2244873046875,
        499.73779296875,
        406.57598876953125
      ],
      "text": "management can still be undertaken even if the TST is not available (see Chapter 5).",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03628540039062,
        417.7309875488281,
        513.4574584960938,
        431.0824890136719
      ],
      "text": "There are a number of methods for performing TSTs, but the Mantoux method is",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03628540039062,
        433.72747802734375,
        513.3653564453125,
        447.0789794921875
      ],
      "text": "recommended. The TST should be standardized for each country using either 5 tuberculin",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03628540039062,
        449.7239685058594,
        513.3883666992188,
        463.0754699707031
      ],
      "text": "units (TU) of tuberculin purified protein derivative (PPD-S) or 2 TU of tuberculin PPD",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03628540039062,
        465.720458984375,
        513.411376953125,
        479.07196044921875
      ],
      "text": "RT23, which give similar reactions in children infected with M. tuberculosis. Health care",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03628540039062,
        481.7169494628906,
        433.1068420410156,
        495.0684509277344
      ],
      "text": "workers must be trained in performing and reading TSTs (see Annex 3).",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03628540039062,
        506.22344970703125,
        268.0357360839844,
        519.574951171875
      ],
      "text": "A TST should be regarded as positive:",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.63939666748047,
        528.5502319335938,
        513.421630859375,
        542.0167236328125
      ],
      "text": "in children who are immunosuppressed (including HIV-positive children and  -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        120.4894027709961,
        542.3501586914062,
        513.3984985351562,
        555.70166015625
      ],
      "text": "severely malnourished children, i.e. those with clinical evidence of marasmus or",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        120.4894027709961,
        556.1502075195312,
        342.7269287109375,
        569.501708984375
      ],
      "text": "kwashiorkor): >5 mm diameter of induration;",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.63939666748047,
        575.6195068359375,
        513.4444580078125,
        589.0859985351562
      ],
      "text": "in all other children (whether they have received a BCG vaccination or not): >10  -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        120.4894027709961,
        590.0175170898438,
        256.58038330078125,
        603.3690185546875
      ],
      "text": "mm diameter of induration.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        611.6887817382812,
        513.4146118164062,
        625.040283203125
      ],
      "text": "There can be false-positive as well as false-negative TST results; possible causes of these",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        627.6163330078125,
        513.368408203125,
        641.0368041992188
      ],
      "text": "not are shown in Annex 3. It is important to note that a negative TST does   rule out",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        643.6128540039062,
        463.9760437011719,
        657.0333251953125
      ],
      "text": "M. tuberculosis infection with   or the possibility of a diagnosis of TB in a child.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        670.849365234375,
        353.0833740234375,
        685.0693359375
      ],
      "text": "Bacteriological confirmation whenever possible",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-BoldItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        693.5928344726562,
        513.4951782226562,
        706.9443359375
      ],
      "text": "Every effort should be made to confirm diagnosis of TB in a child using whatever specimens",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        709.5892944335938,
        513.46044921875,
        722.9407958984375
      ],
      "text": "and laboratory facilities are available. Appropriate specimens from the suspected sites",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        725.5858154296875,
        513.426025390625,
        738.9373168945312
      ],
      "text": "of involvement should be obtained for microscopy and culture (and histopathological",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        741.5823364257812,
        513.3915405273438,
        754.933837890625
      ],
      "text": "examination in extrapulmonary TB whenever possible), although this will depend on",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.74800109863281,
        772.1959838867188,
        513.1653442382812,
        784.1959838867188
      ],
      "text": "However, prior BCG vaccination of the child is a potential cause of a false-positive TST result. The TST might also yield a  1",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        99.92520141601562,
        781.7960205078125,
        513.18115234375,
        793.7960205078125
      ],
      "text": "false-negative result in HIV-positive children and children with severe TB disease, among others, as further discussed in",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        99.92520141601562,
        791.39599609375,
        132.6772003173828,
        803.39599609375
      ],
      "text": "Annex 3",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        14.202799797058105,
        805.8439331054688,
        36.44280242919922,
        835.8439331054688
      ],
      "text": "28",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 20.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    }
  ]
}